WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Instrumental music]
Things Blackboard should’ve shown you.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
When is this due? Did I open it?
In 2 days. Unopened.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
How am I doing in this class?
Your overall grade, on the course card.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Did anything change since Monday?
New-grade and new-content badges.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
What do I need on the final?
A what-if grade calculator. Illustrative scores.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The things it should have shown you all along.
Glaze. Free and open source. Chrome and Safari.
